OL,3,GNEWSAFollow-up appointments scrapped in
OL,4,ANHS waiting lists plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients will not get automatic
OL,7,Ffollow-up appointments after NHS
OL,8,Ftreatment unless they need them, under
OL,9,Fa new Welsh government plan to shrink
OL,10,Fwaiting lists.
OL,12,FMinisters hope the changes will mean
OL,13,Fconsultants can spend more time in
OL,14,Fsurgery rather than clinics.
OL,16,FIt is hoped the move will free up "tens
OL,17,Fof thousands" of hospital appointments
OL,18,Fin Wales for those waiting to be seen
OL,19,Fby a specialist for the first time.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
