OL,3,GNEWSAFollow-up appointments scrapped in
OL,4,ANHS waiting lists plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plan also makes clear that patients
OL,7,Fwho have been waiting the longest
OL,8,Fshould be treated first - unless there
OL,9,Fis a "clear clinical reason" for
OL,10,Fsomeone else to jump the queue.
